  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extensions hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building, and as per the application shall be reclaimed bricks, reclaimed tiles and timber framed windows and timber doors.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposal contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and numbered Planning Statement, Design and Access Statement, Sustainability Checklist, 103-001/P4, 103-002/P4, 103-003/P4, 103-004/P4, 103-005/P4, 103-006/P4, 103-007/P4, 103-008/P4, 103-010/P4, 103-011/P4, Received 24 November 2011, 103-117/P4, 103-119/P4, 103-120/P4, 103-021/P4, 103-023/P4, 103-024/P4, 103-026/P4, 103-027/P4, 103-028/P4, Received 24 November 2011, 103-118/P5, 103-022/P5, Received 17 January 2012, 102-025/P5, Received 24 January 2012  and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 4 - The refuse storage, cycle parking arrangements and trellis fencing shown on the approved drawings shall be completed before any part of the accommodation hereby permitted is occupied."
